rface":"பிரிவு","parts":[{"text":"பிரிவு","lemma":"பிரிவு","gloss":"separation"}],"gloss":"separation"},{"surface":"இல்","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without"},{"surface":"ஆயம்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயம்","lemma":"ஆயம்","gloss":"playmates"}],"gloss":"playmates"},{"surface":"உரியது","parts":[{"text":"உரியது","lemma":"உரியது","gloss":"appropriate thing"}],"gloss":"appropriate things"},{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"to"},{"surface":"அயர","parts":[{"text":"அயர","lemma":"அயர்","gloss":"perform"}],"gloss":"engage in"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இவ்வழி","parts":[{"text":"இவ்வழி","lemma":"இவ்வழி","gloss":"in this place"}],"gloss":"in this place","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"படுதலும்","parts":[{"text":"படுதல்","lemma":"படுதல்","gloss":"staying"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"staying also"},{"surface":"ஒல்லாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்லாள்","lemma":"ஒல்","gloss":"she did not agree"}],"gloss":"she did not agree"},{"surface":"அவ்வழி","parts":[{"text":"அவ்வழி","lemma":"அவ்வழி","gloss":"to that place"}],"gloss":"to that place","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பரல்","parts":[{"text":"பரல்","lemma":"பரல்","gloss":"gravel"}],"gloss":"gravel"},{"surface":"பாழ்","parts":[{"text":"பாழ்","lemma":"பாழ்","gloss":"desolation"}],"gloss":"desolation"},{"surface":"படுப்ப","parts":[{"text":"படுப்ப","lemma":"படுப்ப","gloss":"to cause"}],"gloss":"to cause"},{"surface":"சென்றனள்","parts":[{"text":"சென்றனள்","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"she went"}],"gloss":"she went"},{"surface":"மாதோ","parts":[{"text":"மாதோ","lemma":"மாதோ","gloss":"oh"}],"gloss":"alas"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சென்மழை","parts":[{"text":"சென்மழை","lemma":"சென்மழை","gloss":"moving rain-clouds"}],"gloss":"moving rain-clouds","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தவழும்","parts":[{"text":"தவழும்","lemma":"தவழ்","gloss":"crawl"}],"gloss":"crawl over"},{"surface":"சென்னி","parts":[{"text":"சென்னி","lemma":"சென்னி","gloss":"peak"}],"gloss":"the peaks"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விண்","parts":[{"text":"விண்","lemma":"விண்","gloss":"sky"}],"gloss":"sky"},{"surface":"உயர்","parts":[{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"உயர்","gloss":"high"}],"gloss":"high"},{"surface":"பிறங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"பிறங்கல்","lemma":"பிறங்கல்","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"rising mountains"},{"surface":"விலங்கு","parts":[{"text":"விலங்கு","lemma":"விலங்கு","gloss":"lying across"}],"gloss":"lying across"},{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"நாட்டே","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டே","lemma":"நாட்டே","gloss":"indeed in the land"}],"gloss":"indeed in the land","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"In the backwater blue lilies plucking, of the sea / white-headed waves playing in also was good. / Without separation, the playmates, appropriate things to perform, / in this place staying also she did not agree; to that place, / where gravel is laid waste, she went, alas! / Moving rain-clouds crawl on the peaks / of the sky-high, rising, lying-across mountain land.","translation":"Plucking blue lilies in the backwaters and playing in the white-crested waves of the sea was indeed delightful. Yet, refusing to stay here and engage in familiar games with her inseparable playmates, she has gone, alas, to that place where her path lies over barren, gravelly wastes, heading toward his land of high mountains that rise to the sky, where moving rain-clouds crawl over the peaks.","modern":"கழிகளில் நீலக் குவளை மலர்களைப் பறிப்பதும், கடலின் வெள்ளைத் தலை அலைகளில் விளையாடுவதும் மிகவும் நல்லது. தன்னைப் பிரியாத தோழியர் கூட்டத்துடன் சேர்ந்து விளையாட வேண்டிய விளையாட்டுகளை விளையாடி இங்கேயே தங்குவதற்கும் அவள் உடன்படவில்லை. வானளாவிய, மேகங்கள் தவழும் சிகரங்களைக் கொண்ட மலைநாட்டிற்குச் செல்வதற்காக, கற்கள் நிறைந்த பாழ்வழியில் அவள் அவனுடன் சென்றுவிட்டாளே!","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the foster-mother after the heroine has eloped with her lover. She fondly recalls how the heroine used to spend her days happily on the cool seashore, plucking blue lilies in the backwaters and playing in the white-crested waves. She laments that the girl refused to stay in this comfortable home with her inseparable playmates. Instead, she has chosen to walk through a harsh, desolate path covered in rough gravel to reach the hero's distant mountain country. The contrast between the cool, familiar coast and the hot, painful wasteland highlights the foster-mother's deep grief and anxiety for the young girl's journey.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.4],[2.4,2.6],[2.6,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,4.42],[4.42,4.9],[4.9,5.64],[5.64,6.17],[6.17,7.06],[7.06,7.43],[7.52,7.7],[7.7,8.75],[8.75,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,11.4],[11.4,11.7],[11.7,12.0],[12.0,12.65],[12.65,13.3],[13.3,14.2],[14.2,14.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.99,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,4.72],[4.72,4.86],[5.0,5.88],[5.88,6.1],[6.1,7.59],[8.33,8.7],[8.7,9.11],[9.11,9.63],[9.63,10.15],[10.15,10.66],[10.66,11.18],[11.18,11.39],[11.39,11.8],[11.8,12.2],[12.2,12.4],[12.4,13.7],[13.7,13.9],[13.9,14.8],[14.8,15.2]]},"sync":[[["கழிய","in the backwater"]],[["காவி","blue water lilies"]],[["குற்றும்","and plucking"]],[["கடல","of the sea"]],[["வெண்டலை","white-headed"]],[["புணரி","waves"]],[["யாடியும்","and playing in"]],[["நன்றே","was indeed good"]],[["பிரிவு","separation"]],[["இல்","without"],["ஆயம்","playmates"]],[["ஆயம்","playmates"],["உரியது","appropriate things"],["ஒன்று","to"]],[["ஒன்று","to"],["அயர","engage in"]],[["இவ்வழி","in this place"]],[["படுதலும்","staying also"]],[["ஒல்லாள்","she did not agree"]],[["அவ்வழி","to that place"]],[["பரல்","gravel"],["பாழ்","desolation"]],[["படுப்ப","to cause"],["சென்றனள்","she went"]],[["சென்றனள்","she went"]],[["மாதோ","alas"]],[["சென்மழை","moving rain-clouds"]],[["தவழும்","crawl over"]],[["சென்னி","the peaks"]],[["விண்","sky"],["உயர்","high"]],[["பிறங்கல்","rising mountains"]],[["விலங்கு","lying across"],["மலை","mountain"]],[["நாட்டே","indeed in the land"]]]}